{# Adventurers Guild: this actor's standing with the Guild (guild_rank_of, from AdventurersGuild.dll). Rendered for the
   actor's own bio and, via "dialogue_target", for whoever they are speaking with. A liaison (the innkeeper who keeps a
   hold capital's Guild counter) also knows the counter's business and reads the player's page of the ledger
   (ag_player). The Guild's lore lives in knowledge/adventurers_guild_lore.sknpack; the rules in guidelines/0511. #}
{% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" or render_mode == "transform" or render_mode == "dialogue_target" %}
    {% set ag = guild_rank_of(actorUUID) %}
    {% if ag.status == "member" %}
        - Adventurers Guild: {{ ag.letter }}-rank adventurer
    {% elif ag.status == "retired" %}
        - Adventurers Guild: retired {{ ag.letter }}-rank adventurer, set aside under the Guild's Neutrality Oath when they took up another service; still quietly proud of the old rank
    {% endif %}
    {% if ag.note != "" %}
        - {{ ag.note }}
    {% endif %}
    {# Adventuring parties (ag_party, from AdventurersGuild.dll). The player's party is only common knowledge once it has
       a reputation (renown >= 1); its own members and the Guild reps (below) always know it. #}
    {% set pt = ag_party(actorUUID) %}
    {% if is_player(actorUUID) %}
        {% if pt.party and pt.renown >= 1 %}
        - Leads the adventuring party {{ pt.name }}, together with {{ pt.membersText }}; the party is {{ pt.renownWord }}{% if pt.dungeons > 0 %}, with {{ pt.dungeons }} dungeons cleared together{% endif %}{% if pt.greatBeasts > 0 %} and {{ pt.greatBeasts }} great beasts slain{% endif %}{% if pt.fallenText != "" %}; they have lost {{ pt.fallenText }}{% endif %}
        {% endif %}
    {% else %}
        {% if pt.member %}
        - A sworn member of {{ player.name }}'s adventuring party, {{ pt.memberOf }} (its members: {{ pt.membersText }}); their bond with {{ player.name }} is {{ pt.bond }}. Proud of the party and its name
        {% elif pt.former %}
        - Once travelled with {{ player.name }} in the adventuring party {{ pt.memberOf }}
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
    {% if ag.liaison %}
        - Keeps this hold's Adventurers Guild counter as its licensed liaison: registers new adventurers for a fee, buys monster trophies for Merit, pays out adventurers' reports (gold, Merit and Reputation), sells the Guild's services (dungeon intel, Appraisal, training, library books) for Merit, and hears cases for promotion. As the Guild's rep, knows why its ranks have grown so thin in Skyrim, and it is not for want of work: many of its adventurers died as Legion auxiliaries in the Great War against the Aldmeri Dominion, more were lost or set aside in the civil war, and since the Thalmor got hold of the Guild's ledgers, registered adventurers keep disappearing; the Guild never had it easy here either, up against the Companions and with no halls of its own. Speaks of the disappearances carefully, never where a Thalmor might hear
        {% if render_mode == "full" or render_mode == "thoughts" %}
            {% set led = ag_player(player.UUID) %}
            {% if led.registered %}
        - The Guild's record of {{ player.name }}: {{ led.rank }}-rank adventurer, {{ led.reputation }} Reputation, {{ led.merit }} Merit to spend{% if led.promotionReady %}; eligible for promotion to {{ led.next.rank }}-rank and only needs to ask here and pay the {{ led.promotionFee }} gold promotion fee{% else %}{% if led.next %}; {{ led.next.rank }}-rank needs {{ led.next.reputationShort }} more Reputation{% if led.next.levelShort > 0 %} and more seasoning in the field{% endif %}{% else %}; the highest rank the Guild grants{% endif %}{% endif %}
        - {{ player.name }}'s Appraisal: {% if led.appraisal == "none" %}not learned (they cannot read ranks at all; the first level is sold here for Merit){% else %}level {{ led.appraisal }} of III{% endif %}
        - Does all of {{ player.name }}'s Guild business (jobs, missives, reports, trophies, services, the guild card) at the counter: when {{ player.name }} brings Adventurers Guild business, opens the counter for them with the AG_OpenGuildCounter action
            {% set lp = ag_party(player.UUID) %}
            {% if lp.party %}
        - {{ player.name }} leads the adventuring party {{ lp.name }}, registered with the Adventurers Guild: {{ lp.membersText }}; their bond is {{ lp.bondTier }}, {{ lp.days }} days on the road together, {{ lp.dungeons }} dungeons and {{ lp.missives }} missives; the party is {{ lp.renownWord }}{% if lp.fallenText != "" %}; lost: {{ lp.fallenText }}{% endif %}
            {% endif %}
                {% if led.hasCard == false %}
        - {{ player.name }} no longer carries their guild card: a replacement costs exactly {{ led.cardFee }} gold (never quote any other amount); when they ask for one and agree to the fee, hands it over with the AG_ReplaceGuildCard action
                {% endif %}
                {% if led.reportsWaiting.count > 0 %}
        - {{ player.name }} has {{ led.reportsWaiting.count }} finished job(s) not yet reported to the Guild, worth {{ led.reportsWaiting.gold }} gold, {{ led.reportsWaiting.merit }} Merit and {{ led.reportsWaiting.reputation }} Reputation when handed in at a counter
                {% endif %}
                {% if led.trophiesCarried.kinds > 0 %}
        - {{ player.name }} carries monster trophies the Guild would buy, worth about {{ led.trophiesCarried.merit }} Merit
                {% endif %}
            {% else %}
        - {{ player.name }} is not registered with the Adventurers Guild; registration can be done at this counter for a fee of exactly {{ led.registrationFee }} gold (never quote any other amount)
            {% endif %}
        {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
{% endif %}
